  "title": "Composite vs Direct Brokers Explained",
  "summary": "Composite brokers manage both insurance and reinsurance, making them suitable for multinationals with complex global risks. Direct brokers specialize in employee health benefits, offering lower costs, faster claims, and sharper service for Indian companies. Learn why direct brokers are the smarter choice for most HR and CFO leaders evaluating group health insurance.",
